#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2934
msgid "About Advanced IP Blocker"
msgstr "Acerca de Advanced IP Blocker"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2937
msgid "Version:"
msgstr "Versión:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2938
msgid ""
"Thank you for using our plugin! This tool helps protect your WordPress site "
"by automatically blocking malicious IPs based on their behavior."
msgstr ""
"¡Gracias por usar nuestro plugin! Esta herramienta ayuda a proteger tu sitio "
"de WordPress bloqueando automáticamente las IP maliciosas según su "
"comportamiento."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2940
msgid "Key Features Overview:"
msgstr "Descripción general de las características clave:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2942
msgid "Zero-Day Vulnerability Prevention:"
msgstr "Prevención de vulnerabilidades Zero-Day:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2942
msgid ""
"Deploys surgical WAF rules to block exploits targeting newly discovered and "
"unpatched vulnerabilities before they compromise your site."
msgstr ""
"Implementa reglas de WAF quirúrgicas para bloquear exploits dirigidos a "
"vulnerabilidades recién descubiertas y sin parchear, antes de que "
"comprometan su sitio."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2943
msgid "Advanced Rules Cloud Sync:"
msgstr "Sincronización en lCloud de reglas avanzadas:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2943
msgid ""
"Automatically synchronizes your local WAF rules and signatures with our "
"centralized cloud database, ensuring you are always protected against the "
"latest global threats."
msgstr ""
"Sincroniza automáticamente sus reglas y firmas locales de WAF con nuestra "
"base de datos centralizada en Cloud, garantizando que esté siempre protegido "
"frente a las amenazas globales más recientes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2944
msgid "Site Health & Vulnerability Scanner:"
msgstr "Escáner de vulnerabilidad y salud del sitio:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2944
msgid ""
"Audit your WordPress environment for weaknesses and check installed plugins "
"against a database of 30,000+ known security vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"Audite su entorno de WordPress para detectar debilidades y verifique los "
"plugins y temas instalados contra una base de datos de más de 30 000 "
"vulnerabilidades de seguridad conocidas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2945
msgid "File Integrity Monitoring (FIM):"
msgstr "Monitoreo de la integridad de archivos (FIM):"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2945
msgid ""
"Continuously monitors your WordPress core, plugin, and theme files for "
"unauthorized changes or malware injections, alerting you instantly."
msgstr ""
"Monitorea continuamente los archivos del núcleo de WordPress, los plugins y "
"los temas en busca de cambios no autorizados o inyecciones de malware, "
"alertándote al instante."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2946
msgid "Manual Integrity Scanner:"
msgstr "Escáner de integridad manual:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2946
msgid ""
"Perform on-demand, deep scans of your entire filesystem to verify file "
"checksums and detect hidden modifications or backdoors."
msgstr ""
"Realice análisis exhaustivos y bajo demanda de todo su sistema de archivos "
"para verificar las sumas de comprobación de los archivos y detectar "
"modificaciones ocultas o puertas traseras."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2947
msgid "Community Defense Network:"
msgstr "Red de Defensa Comunitaria:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2947
msgid ""
"A global collaborative network that shares verified attack data to block "
"emerging threats in real-time across all participating sites."
msgstr ""
"Una red colaborativa global que comparte datos de ataques verificados para "
"bloquear amenazas emergentes en tiempo real en todos los sitios "
"participantes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2948
msgid "Distributed Attack Protection (Auto-Panic):"
msgstr "Protección contra ataques distribuidos  (Auto-Panic):"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2948
msgid ""
"Automatically shields your entire site with a global JS challenge during "
"massive traffic spikes, keeping your server online while intelligently "
"bypassing trusted bots and excluded routes."
msgstr ""
"Protege automáticamente todo tu sitio web con un desafío global de "
"JavaScript durante picos de tráfico masivos, manteniendo tu servidor en "
"línea y evitando de forma inteligente los bots de confianza y las rutas "
"excluidas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2949
msgid "Ghost IP Defense:"
msgstr "Defensa Ghost IP:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2949
msgid ""
"Automatically detects and blocks stealthy \"Ghost IPs\" that lack ASN or "
"Reverse DNS (rDNS) records, shielding your site from sophisticated "
"anonymized attacks and untraceable bots."
msgstr ""
"Detecta y bloquea automáticamente \"Ghost IPs\" sigilosas que carecen de "
"registros ASN o Reverse DNS (rDNS), protegiendo su sitio de ataques anónimos "
"sofisticados y bots irrastreables."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2950
msgid "IP Inspector:"
msgstr "IP Inspector:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2950
msgid ""
"A comprehensive diagnostic tool to analyze any IP address or ASN against all "
"security layers, local whitelists, and third-party threat databases in real-"
"time."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de diagnóstico integral para analizar cualquier dirección IP "
"o ASN comparándola con todas las capas de seguridad, listas blancas locales "
"y bases de datos de amenazas de terceros en tiempo real."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2951
msgid "Cloud Edge Defense (Cloudflare):"
msgstr "Defensa Cloud Edge (Cloudflare)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2951
msgid ""
"Connects your site to the Cloudflare Firewall to block malicious IPs at the "
"network edge, preventing them from ever reaching your server. Zero load "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"Conecta tu sitio al firewall de Cloudflare para bloquear IP maliciosas en el "
"borde de la red, impidiendo que lleguen a tu servidor. Protección de carga "
"cero."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2952
msgid "Server-Level Firewall (.htaccess):"
msgstr "Server-Level Firewall (.htaccess)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2952
msgid ""
"Writes blocking rules directly to your server configuration for extreme "
"performance. Also hardens sensitive files like wp-config.php."
msgstr ""
"Escribe reglas de bloqueo directamente en la configuración de tu servidor "
"para un rendimiento excepcional. También protege archivos confidenciales "
"como wp-config.php."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2953
msgid "AbuseIPDB Integration:"
msgstr "Integración de AbuseIPDB:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2953
msgid ""
"Proactively checks visitor IP reputation against a global crowdsourced "
"database of hackers and spammers, blocking bad actors on their very first "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Verifica de forma proactiva la reputación de IP del visitante comparándola "
"con una base de datos global de piratas informáticos y spammers, y bloquea a "
"los actores maliciosos en su primera solicitud."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2954
msgid "IP Trust & Threat Scoring System:"
msgstr "Puntuación de confianza y amenazas de IP:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2954
msgid ""
"An advanced defense that assigns threat points for malicious actions, "
"blocking IPs based on their cumulative score for more accurate, context-"
"aware security."
msgstr ""
"Una defensa avanzada que asigna puntos de amenaza para acciones maliciosas y "
"bloquea IP según su puntaje acumulativo para una seguridad más precisa y "
"consciente del contexto."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2955
msgid "Attack Signature Engine:"
msgstr "Motor de firmas de ataque:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2955
msgid ""
"A proactive defense that detects distributed botnet attacks by analyzing "
"request \"fingerprints\" and stops them with an invisible JavaScript "
"challenge."
msgstr ""
"Una defensa proactiva que detecta ataques de botnets distribuidos mediante "
"el análisis de las \"huellas dactilares\" de las solicitudes y los detiene "
"con un desafío de JavaScript invisible."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2956
msgid "Endpoint Lockdown Mode:"
msgstr "Modo Endpoint Lockdown:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2956
msgid ""
"Automatically shields critical endpoints like wp-login.php and xmlrpc.php "
"with a challenge mode during sustained distributed attacks, preventing "
"server overload."
msgstr ""
"Protege automáticamente puntos finales críticos como wp-login.php y "
"xmlrpc.php con un modo de desafío durante ataques distribuidos sostenidos, "
"lo que evita la sobrecarga del servidor."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2957
msgid "Captcha Integrations (Turnstile & hCaptcha):"
msgstr "Integraciones de CAPTCHA (Turnstile y hCaptcha):"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2957
msgid ""
"Seamlessly integrate modern verification challenges like Cloudflare "
"Turnstile and hCaptcha, with granular control per module and a smart "
"fallback to our invisible JS Challenge to prevent accidental lockouts."
msgstr ""
"Integre sin problemas desafíos de verificación modernos, como Cloudflare "
"Turnstile y hCaptcha, con control granular por módulo y un mecanismo "
"inteligente de respaldo a nuestro desafío JS invisible para evitar bloqueos "
"accidentales."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2958
msgid "Two-Factor Authentication (2FA):"
msgstr "Autenticación de dos factores (2FA):"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2958
msgid ""
"Secure user accounts with TOTP authentication, backup codes, and role "
"enforcement. Fully manageable via UI and WP-CLI."
msgstr ""
"Cuentas de usuario seguras con autenticación TOTP, códigos de respaldo y "
"aplicación de roles. Totalmente gestionable mediante la interfaz de usuario "
"y WP-CLI."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2959
msgid "Security Dashboard:"
msgstr "Panel de Seguridad:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2959
msgid ""
"Get a real-time visual overview of all threats with interactive charts and a "
"live attack map."
msgstr ""
"Obtenga una descripción visual en tiempo real de todas las amenazas con "
"gráficos interactivos y un mapa de ataques en vivo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2960
msgid "High-Performance Geolocation:"
msgstr "Geolocalización de alto rendimiento:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2960
msgid ""
"Choose between real-time APIs or a high-performance local MaxMind database "
"for IP lookups, ensuring speed and reliability."
msgstr ""
"Elija entre API en tiempo real o una base de datos MaxMind local de alto "
"rendimiento para búsquedas de IP, lo que garantiza velocidad y confiabilidad."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2961
msgid "Web Application Firewall (WAF):"
msgstr "Firewall de aplicaciones web (WAF)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2961
msgid ""
"Proactively block malicious requests (SQLi, XSS, etc.) with customizable "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"Bloquee proactivamente solicitudes maliciosas (SQLi, XSS, etc.) con reglas "
"personalizables."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2962
msgid "Rate Limiting:"
msgstr "Rate Limiting:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2962
msgid "Prevent DoS and brute-force attacks by limiting request frequency."
msgstr ""
"Evite ataques DoS y de fuerza bruta limitando la frecuencia de solicitudes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2963
msgid "Country & ASN Blocking:"
msgstr "Bloqueo por país y ASN:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2963
msgid ""
"Block traffic from entire countries or networks (ASNs), with support for the "
"Spamhaus list and a new ASN Whitelist feature."
msgstr ""
"Bloquea el tráfico de países o redes enteros (ASN), con soporte para la "
"lista Spamhaus y una nueva función de lista blanca de ASN."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2964
msgid "Advanced Login Protection:"
msgstr "Protección de inicio de sesión avanzada:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2964
msgid ""
"Harden your login page by disabling user enumeration, protecting XML-RPC, "
"and restricting access to whitelisted IPs."
msgstr ""
"Fortalezca su página de inicio de sesión deshabilitando la enumeración de "
"usuarios, protegiendo XML-RPC y restringiendo el acceso a direcciones IP "
"incluidas en la lista blanca."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2965
msgid "Comprehensive Audit Logging:"
msgstr "Registro de auditoría exhaustivo:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2965
msgid ""
"Tracks and logs all critical administrative actions and configuration "
"changes, providing a complete security trail for forensic analysis."
msgstr ""
"Registra y rastrea todas las acciones administrativas críticas y los cambios "
"de configuración, proporcionando un historial de seguridad completo para el "
"análisis forense."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2969
msgid "Support This Plugin"
msgstr "Apoya Este Plugin"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2971
msgid ""
"If you find this plugin useful, please consider supporting its development. "
"Your donation helps keep the project alive and ad-free. Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"Si encuentras útil este plugin, por favor considera apoyar su desarrollo. Tu "
"donación ayuda a mantener el proyecto vivo y sin publicidad. ¡Gracias!"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2980
msgid "You are free to choose the amount you donate."
msgstr "Eres libre de elegir la cantidad que donas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2981
msgid "Other ways to support:"
msgstr "Otras formas de apoyar:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2984
msgid "Bitcoin (BTC):"
msgstr "Bitcoin (BTC):"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2985
msgid "Ethereum (ETH):"
msgstr "Ethereum (ETH):"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2991
msgid "WP-CLI Interface"
msgstr "WP-CLI Interface"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2993
msgid ""
"This plugin is fully manageable via the WordPress command line. This allows "
"developers and system administrators to automate tasks and manage the plugin "
"remotely."
msgstr ""
"Este complemento se puede gestionar completamente desde la línea de comandos "
"de WordPress. Esto permite a los desarrolladores y administradores de "
"sistemas automatizar tareas y gestionar el complemento de forma remota."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:2995
msgid "View Available Commands"
msgstr "Ver comandos disponibles"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3047
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Soporte"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3051
