msgstr "Sitio web oficial"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3052
msgid ""
"Visit our official website for documentation, advanced guides, and more "
"information about the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Visita nuestro sitio web oficial para obtener documentación, guías avanzadas "
"y más información sobre el plugin."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3053
msgid "Visit advaipbl.com"
msgstr "Visita advaipbl.com"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3056
msgid "Need Help?"
msgstr "¿Necesitas ayuda?"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3057
msgid ""
"If you have encountered a bug or have a question, please open a support "
"ticket on the WordPress.org forums."
msgstr ""
"Si ha encontrado un error o tiene alguna pregunta, abra un ticket de soporte "
"en los foros de WordPress.org."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3058
msgid "Open Support Ticket"
msgstr "Abrir ticket de soporte"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3063
msgid "Credits and Attributions"
msgstr "Créditos y atribuciones"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3065
msgid "Included Libraries & Services"
msgstr "Bibliotecas y servicios incluidos"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3067
msgid "For local database geolocation."
msgstr "Para geolocalización de bases de datos locales."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3068
msgid "For automated blocking of malicious networks."
msgstr "Para el bloqueo automático de redes maliciosas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3069
msgid "For the interactive Security Dashboard."
msgstr "Para el panel de seguridad interactivo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3070
msgid "For the Dashboard map tiles."
msgstr "Para los mosaicos del mapa del Dashboard."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3071
msgid "The core library powering our 2FA functionality."
msgstr "La biblioteca principal que impulsa nuestra funcionalidad 2FA."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3072
msgid "For the user-friendly country selector."
msgstr "Para el selector de países fácil de usar."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3073
msgid "For crowdsourced IP reputation checking."
