"Importing a settings file will overwrite ALL your current plugin settings. "
"This action cannot be undone. Please create a backup first."
msgstr ""
"Al importar un archivo de configuración, se sobrescribirán todas las "
"configuraciones actuales del plugin. Esta acción es irreversible. Cree "
"primero una copia de seguridad."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3532
msgid "Select the JSON configuration file to import:"
msgstr "Seleccione el archivo de configuración JSON que desea importar:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3537
msgid "Import and Overwrite Settings"
msgstr "Importar y sobrescribir configuraciones"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3555
msgid "Advanced IP Blocker Setup"
msgstr "Configuración Advanced IP Blocker"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3559
msgid "Step 1: Welcome & Whitelist Your IPs"
msgstr "Paso 1: Bienvenido y lista blanca de tus IP"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3560
msgid ""
"Welcome! This wizard will guide you through the essential security settings "
"in under a minute."
msgstr ""
"¡Bienvenido! Este asistente te guiará por la configuración de seguridad "
"esencial en menos de un minuto."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3561
msgid "This first step is the most important."
msgstr "Este primer paso es el más importante."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3561
msgid ""
"To prevent you from accidentally locking yourself out, we will add your "
"current IP address and your server's IP to the permanent whitelist."
msgstr ""
"Para evitar que se bloquee accidentalmente, agregaremos su dirección IP "
"actual y la IP de su servidor a la lista blanca permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3570
msgid "Your IP Address:"
msgstr "Su dirección IP:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3571
msgid "Server IP Address:"
msgstr "Dirección IP del servidor:"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3576
msgid "Cloudflare Detected!"
msgstr "¡Cloudflare detectado!"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3576
msgid ""
"We noticed you are using Cloudflare. We will automatically configure the "
"correct IP detection settings to prevent false blocks."
msgstr ""
"Hemos detectado que utilizas Cloudflare. Configuraremos automáticamente los "
"ajustes de detección de IP para evitar bloqueos erróneos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3580
msgid "Using a Proxy/CDN?"
msgstr "¿Utilizas un proxy/CDN?"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3580
msgid ""
"If your traffic goes through proxies like Sucuri or AWS ELB, you must "
"configure Trusted Proxies in the Settings tab later to avoid blocking "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Si su tráfico pasa por servidores proxy como Sucuri o AWS ELB, deberá "
"configurar los Proxies de confianza en la pestaña Configuración más adelante "
"para evitar bloqueos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3590
msgid "Whitelist IPs & Continue"
msgstr "Añadir IPs y continuar"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3594
msgid "Skip this step (not recommended)"
msgstr "Omitir este paso (no recomendado)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3600
msgid "Step 2: Activate Bot & Scanner Traps"
msgstr "Step 2: Activar trampas a Bots & Scanner"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3601
msgid ""
"These are low-risk, high-reward defenses. We will enable protections that "
"instantly block known malicious bots and vulnerability scanners."
msgstr ""
"Estas son defensas de bajo riesgo y alta rentabilidad. Habilitaremos "
"protecciones que bloquean instantáneamente bots maliciosos conocidos y "
"escáneres de vulnerabilidades."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3611
msgid "Block Malicious User-Agents"
msgstr "Bloquear User-Agents maliciosos"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3612
msgid ""
"Applies a curated list of known bad bot and scanner user-agents to the "
"blocklist."
msgstr ""
"Aplica una lista seleccionada de agentes de usuario de escáneres y bots "
"maliciosos conocidos a la lista de bloqueo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3620
msgid "Activate Honeypot Traps"
msgstr "Activar trampas de honeypot"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3621
msgid ""
"Applies a list of \"bait\" URLs. Any bot that tries to access them will be "
"instantly blocked."
msgstr ""
"Aplica una lista de URLs cebo. Cualquier bot que intente acceder a ellas "
"será bloqueado al instante."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3629
msgid "Enable Smart XML-RPC Protection"
msgstr "Habilitar la protección inteligente de XML-RPC"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3630
msgid ""
"(Recommended) Blocks brute-force attacks on xmlrpc.php while allowing "
"legitimate services like Jetpack to function."
msgstr ""
"(Recomendado) Bloquea los ataques de fuerza bruta en xmlrpc.php, al tiempo "
"que permite que funcionen servicios legítimos como Jetpack."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3638
msgid "Block Ghost IPs / Anonymous Traffic"
msgstr "Bloquear IPs fantasma / tráfico anónimo"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3639
msgid ""
"Instantly drops malicious HTTP/1.0 requests with missing Host headers "
"typical of legacy vulnerability scanners."
msgstr ""
"Descarta inmediatamente las solicitudes HTTP/1.0 maliciosas que carecen de "
"encabezados Host, típicas de los escáneres de vulnerabilidades antiguos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3646
msgid "Activate Recommended Defenses"
msgstr "Activar defensas recomendadas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3649
#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3718
#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3745
msgid "Skip this step"
msgstr "Salta este paso"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3655
msgid "Step 3: Activate Proactive Defenses"
msgstr "Paso 3: Activar defensas proactivas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3656
msgid ""
"Now let's enable the firewall to protect your site from more advanced "
"attacks like SQL injection and prevent server overload from aggressive bots."
msgstr ""
"Ahora habilitemos el firewall para proteger su sitio de ataques más "
"avanzados como la inyección SQL y evitar la sobrecarga del servidor por "
"parte de bots agresivos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3666
msgid "Enable Web Application Firewall (WAF)"
msgstr "Habilitar el firewall de aplicaciones web (WAF)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3667
msgid ""
"Applies our recommended set of WAF rules to block common hacking patterns."
msgstr ""
"Aplica nuestro conjunto recomendado de reglas WAF para bloquear patrones de "
"piratería comunes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3675
msgid "Enable Request Rate Limiting"
msgstr "Habilitar limitación de tasa de solicitudes"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3676
msgid ""
"Temporarily blocks IPs that make an excessive number of requests, protecting "
"against DoS attacks."
msgstr ""
"Bloquea temporalmente las IP que realizan una cantidad excesiva de "
"solicitudes, protegiendo contra ataques DoS."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3684
msgid "Enable Spamhaus ASN Protection"
msgstr "Habilitar la protección ASN de Spamhaus"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3685
msgid ""
"Automatically blocks thousands of the most malicious networks on the "
"internet."
msgstr "Bloquea automáticamente miles de las redes más maliciosas de Internet."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3693
msgid "Enable Server-Level Firewall (.htaccess)"
msgstr "Habilitar firewall a nivel de servidor (.htaccess)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3694
msgid ""
"Automatically writes blocking rules and file hardening protections to "
"your .htaccess file for maximum performance."
msgstr ""
"Escribe automáticamente reglas de bloqueo y protecciones de refuerzo de "
"archivos en su archivo .htaccess para obtener el máximo rendimiento."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3702
msgid "Join AIB Community Defense"
