"<a href=\"https://advaipbl.com/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\">Learn "
"More</a> about what we collect."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://advaipbl.com/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\">Más "
"información</a> sobre lo que recopilamos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:104
msgid "Enable Email Notifications"
msgstr "Habilitar notificaciones por correo electrónico"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:104
msgid "Send an email when an IP is blocked."
msgstr "Envía un correo electrónico cuando una IP esté bloqueada."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:106
msgid "Leave empty to use the admin email."
msgstr "Dejar vacío para usar el email del admin."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:107
msgid "Send Test Email"
msgstr "Enviar correo electrónico de prueba"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:110
msgid "Enable Push Notifications"
msgstr "Habilitar notificaciones push"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:110
msgid "Send real-time alerts via webhooks."
msgstr "Envía alertas en tiempo real a través de webhooks."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:112
msgid "Push Webhook URLs"
msgstr "URL de Webhook Push"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:112
msgid "One URL per line."
msgstr "Una URL por línea."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:114
msgid "Mentions to Trigger Push"
msgstr "Menciones a Trigger Push"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:114
msgid ""
"Optional. To force a push notification on Slack/Discord, add a mention like "
"<code>@here</code>, <code>@channel</code>, or a specific <code>@username</"
"code>. Add one per line if needed."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Para forzar una notificación push en Slack/Discord, añade una "
"mención como <code>@here</code>, <code>@channell</code> o un "
"<code>@username</code> específico. Añade una por línea si es necesario."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:115
msgid "Send Critical Alerts Only"
msgstr "Enviar solo alertas críticas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:115
msgid ""
"Only send alerts for instant blocks (WAF, Honeypot, etc.), not for threshold-"
"based blocks (404, Login)."
msgstr ""
"Solo envía alertas para bloqueos instantáneos (WAF, Honeypot, etc.), no para "
"bloqueos basados en umbrales (404, inicio de sesión)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:116
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2484
msgid "Send Test Notification"
msgstr "Enviar notificación de prueba"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:120
msgid ""
"We have detected that Imagick is active on your server. We strongly "
"recommend enabling this option to force the use of GD and prevent image "
"processing vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"Hemos detectado que Imagick está activo en su servidor. Recomendamos "
"encarecidamente habilitar esta opción para forzar el uso de GD y prevenir "
"vulnerabilidades en el procesamiento de imágenes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:121
msgid ""
"Your server already has Imagick disabled at the system level. You are "
"protected by default."
msgstr ""
"Tu servidor ya tiene Imagick deshabilitado a nivel de sistema. Estás "
"protegido por defecto."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:133
msgid "Disable Imagick and force GD Library for image processing."
msgstr ""
"Deshabilita Imagick y fuerza el uso de la biblioteca GD para el "
"procesamiento de imágenes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:134
msgid ""
"Mitigates critical Remote Code Execution (RCE) vulnerabilities in "
"ImageMagick/Ghostscript (like CVE-2026-65640)."
msgstr ""
"Mitiga vulnerabilidades críticas de ejecución remota de código (RCE) en "
"ImageMagick/Ghostscript (como CVE-2026-65640)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:140
msgid "Hide WordPress Version"
msgstr "Ocultar la versión de WordPress"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:146
msgid ""
"Remove WordPress version generator meta tag and query strings from scripts/"
"styles."
msgstr ""
"Elimina la etiqueta meta que indica la versión de WordPress y las cadenas de "
"consulta de los scripts y estilos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:147
msgid ""
"Prevents automated scanners from easily detecting outdated/vulnerable "
"WordPress versions."
msgstr ""
"Evita que los escáneres automatizados detecten fácilmente versiones de "
"WordPress obsoletas o vulnerables."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:153
msgid "Disable Application Passwords"
msgstr "Desactivar contraseñas de aplicación"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:159
msgid "Disable the REST API Application Passwords feature."
msgstr "Deshabilite la función de contraseñas de aplicación de la API REST."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:160
msgid ""
"Closes a common vector for brute-force attacks via the WP REST API if you do "
"not use them."
msgstr ""
"Cierra una vía común para ataques de fuerza bruta a través de la API REST de "
"WordPress si no la utilizas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:172
msgid "Disable the built-in WordPress theme and plugin editor."
msgstr "Desactiva el editor de temas y plugins integrado de WordPress."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:173
msgid ""
"Prevents attackers from injecting malicious PHP code directly from the "
"dashboard if an admin account is compromised."
msgstr ""
"Evita que los atacantes inyecten código PHP malicioso directamente desde el "
"panel de control si se ve comprometida una cuenta de administrador."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:185
msgid "Block execution of PHP files in the `/wp-content/uploads/` directory."
msgstr ""
"Bloquea la ejecución de archivos PHP en el directorio `/wp-content/uploads/`."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:186
msgid ""
"Creates an isolated .htaccess file to immunize your media folder against PHP "
"shell execution."
msgstr ""
"Crea un archivo .htaccess aislado para inmunizar tu carpeta de medios contra "
"la ejecución de shells PHP."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:192
msgid "Remove powered by HTTP header"
msgstr "Eliminar la cabecera HTTP powered by"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:198
msgid ""
"Remove information about software used by your site. E.g., X-Powered-By: PHP/"
"7.4.1"
msgstr ""
"Elimina la información sobre el software utilizado por tu sitio. Por "
"ejemplo: X-Powered-By: PHP/7.4.1"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:210
msgid ""
"Select which Administrators are allowed to view and configure this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione qué administradores tienen permiso para ver y configurar este "
"plugin."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:211
msgid ""
"By default, all administrators can manage the plugin. The primary admin (ID "
"1) can never be locked out."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, todos los administradores pueden gestionar el plugin. El "
"administrador principal (ID 1) nunca puede quedar bloqueado."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:219
msgid "Enable Scheduled Scans"
msgstr "Habilitar escaneos programados"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:225
msgid "Automatically run Deep Scans and email the report."
msgstr ""
"Ejecutar automáticamente Deep Scans y enviar el informe por correo "
"electrónico."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:231
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1381
msgid "Scan Frequency"
msgstr "Frecuencia de escaneo"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:245
msgid "Where to send the scan reports (leave blank for admin email)."
msgstr ""
"Dónde enviar los informes de escaneo (déjelo en blanco para el correo "
"electrónico del administrador)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:251
msgid "Run Manual Scan & Email"
msgstr "Ejecutar escaneo manual y enviar por correo electrónico"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:259
msgid "Alert Trigger Rule"
msgstr "Regla de activación de alerta"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:266
msgid ""
"Send email when ANY issue is found (Updates, Vulnerabilities, Env Errors)"
msgstr ""
"Enviar correo electrónico cuando se detecte CUALQUIER problema "
"(actualizaciones, vulnerabilidades, errores de entorno)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:267
msgid ""
"Agency Mode: ONLY send email if Critical Vulnerabilities (CVEs) or "
"Blacklists are detected. (Ignores standard updates)"
msgstr ""
"Modo Agencia: Solo se enviará un correo electrónico si se detectan "
"vulnerabilidades críticas (CVE) o se incluyen elementos en listas negras. "
"(Ignora las actualizaciones estándar)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:268
msgid "Always send report, even if the site is completely clean."
msgstr ""
"Envíe siempre el informe, incluso si el sitio está completamente limpio."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:271
msgid "Choose when the automatic scan should notify you."
msgstr "Elige cuándo debes recibir las notificaciones del análisis automático."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:275
msgid "Check Vulnerabilities (CVE)"
msgstr "Verificación de vulnerabilidades (CVE)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:275
msgid ""
"Enable scanning active plugins and themes against the known vulnerabilities "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Habilita el análisis de los plugins y temas activos contra la base de datos "
"de vulnerabilidades conocidas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:276
msgid "Check SSL Certificate"
msgstr "Verificar certificado SSL"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:276
msgid "Enable SSL/TLS certificate validation."
msgstr "Habilitar la validación del certificado SSL/TLS."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:277
msgid "Check Updates"
msgstr "Check Updates"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:277
msgid "Enable core, plugin, and theme update checks."
msgstr ""
"Habilitar comprobaciones de actualizaciones de núcleo, complementos y temas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:278
msgid "Check PHP Version"
msgstr "Verifique la versión de PHP"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:278
msgid "Enable PHP version compatibility checks."
msgstr "Habilitar comprobaciones de compatibilidad de versiones de PHP."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:279
msgid "Check WordPress Version"
msgstr "Verifique la versión de WordPress"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:279
msgid "Enable WordPress core version checks."
msgstr "Habilitar comprobaciones de la versión principal de WordPress."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:280
msgid "Check Debug Mode"
msgstr "Verificar el modo de depuración"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:280
msgid "Enable WP_DEBUG status checks."
msgstr "Habilitar comprobaciones de estado WP_DEBUG."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:291
msgid "Trusted Proxies"
msgstr "Proxies de confianza"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:299
msgid ""
"Enter one IP, CIDR range, or ASN per line. Use # for comments. "
"<strong>Example:</strong><br><code># Cloudflare<br>AS13335<br># Varnish "
"Server<br>192.168.0.1<br># Nginx Proxy<br>127.0.0.1</code>"
msgstr ""
"Ingrese una IP, un rango CIDR o un ASN por línea. Use # para comentarios. "
"<strong>Ejemplo:</strong><br><code># Cloudflare<br>AS13335<br># Varnish "
"Server<br>192.168.0.1<br># Nginx Proxy<br>127.0.0.1</code>"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:323
msgid "Enable AbuseIPDB Protection"
msgstr "Habilitar la protección AbuseIPDB"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:329
msgid "Activate real-time IP reputation checking."
msgstr "Activar la comprobación de reputación IP en tiempo real."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:336
msgid "AbuseIPDB API Key"
msgstr "Clave API de AbuseIPDB"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:349
msgid "Blocking Confidence Score"
msgstr "Puntuación de confianza de bloqueo"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:356
msgid ""
"Block IPs with an abuse confidence score of this value or higher (0-100). "
"Recommended: 90 or 100."
msgstr ""
"Bloquea las direcciones IP con una puntuación de confianza de abuso igual o "
"superior a este valor (0-100). Recomendado: 90 o 100."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:362
msgid "Action on High Score"
msgstr "Acción en puntuación alta"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:368
msgid ""
"Choose whether to block high-risk IPs immediately or to present them with a "
"JavaScript challenge."
msgstr ""
"Elija si desea bloquear inmediatamente las direcciones IP de alto riesgo o "
"presentarles un desafío de JavaScript."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:374
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:447
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:721
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1156
msgid "Block Duration (minutes)"
msgstr "Duración Bloqueo (minutos)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:381
msgid ""
"How long to block an IP flagged by AbuseIPDB. Set to 0 for a permanent block."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de bloqueo de una IP marcada por AbuseIPDB. Establecer en 0 para un "
"bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:389
msgid "AIB Account Connection"
msgstr "Conexión de cuenta AIB"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:397
msgid "API Token"
msgstr "API Token"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:403
msgid ""
"Connecting to the Advanced IP Blocker cloud network gives you access to the "
"community blocklist and deep site scanning."
msgstr ""
"Al conectarse a la red en la nube de Advanced IP Blocker, tendrá acceso a la "
"lista de bloqueo de la comunidad y al escaneo profundo del sitio."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:409
msgid "Join Community Defense Network"
msgstr "Únase a la red de defensa comunitaria"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:415
msgid "Enable Community Defense"
msgstr "Habilitar la defensa comunitaria"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:416
msgid ""
"Participate in the global defense network. Your plugin will share anonymized "
"attack data (Verified IPs) to help build the <strong>AIB Community "
"Blocklist</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Participa en la red global de defensa. Tu plugin compartirá datos de ataques "
"anónimos (IP verificadas) para ayudar a crear la lista de bloqueo de la "
"comunidad AIB."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:423
msgid "Enable Community Blocking"
msgstr "Habilitar el bloqueo de la comunidad"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:429
msgid "Block visitors found in the global AIB Community Blocklist."
msgstr ""
"Bloquear a los visitantes que se encuentran en la lista de bloqueo global de "
"la comunidad AIB."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:441
msgid "Decide how to handle IPs listed in the community database."
msgstr ""
"Decidir cómo manejar las direcciones IP enumeradas en la base de datos de la "
"comunidad."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:454
msgid ""
"How long to block an IP listed in the community database. Set to 0 for a "
"permanent block."
msgstr ""
"¿Cuánto tiempo se bloquea una IP registrada en la base de datos de la "
"comunidad? Se establece en 0 para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:460
msgid "Minimum Threat Score"
msgstr "Puntuación mínima de amenaza"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:467
msgid ""
"Only import IPs that have been reported by at least this many unique "
"community members. (Default: 1)"
msgstr ""
"Importar únicamente las direcciones IP que hayan sido reportadas por al "
"menos esta cantidad de miembros únicos de la comunidad. (Predeterminado: 1)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:474
