msgstr "Habilitar el bloqueo geográfico"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:494
msgid "Activate country-based blocking."
msgstr "Activar el bloqueo basado en país."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:494
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2357
msgid ""
"Block access from entire countries. This feature requires a working "
"Geolocation Provider to be configured above."
msgstr ""
"Bloquear el acceso desde países enteros. Esta función requiere que se "
"configure un proveedor de geolocalización activo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:496
msgid "Geoblock Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración del geobloqueo (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:496
msgid ""
"How long an IP from a blocked country will be blocked. Set to 0 for a "
"permanent block."
msgstr ""
"Cuánto tiempo permanecerá bloqueada una IP de un país bloqueado. Se "
"establece en 0 para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:501
msgid "Enable Geo-Challenge"
msgstr "Habilitar desafío geográfico"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:507
msgid "Activate country-based JavaScript challenge."
msgstr "Activar el desafío de JavaScript basado en el país."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:508
msgid ""
"Instead of a hard block, this presents a quick, invisible JavaScript "
"challenge..."
msgstr ""
"En lugar de un bloqueo rígido, esto presenta un desafío rápido e invisible "
"de JavaScript..."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:513
msgid "Challenged Countries"
msgstr "Países desafiados"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:521
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:644
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:693
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:709
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:812
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:884
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1204
msgid "Challenge Mode"
msgstr "Modo desafío"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:528
msgid "Automatic (Transparent) vs Managed (User must interact)."
msgstr ""
"Automático (transparente) frente a gestionado (el usuario debe interactuar)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:535
msgid "Enable Honeypot Blocking"
msgstr "Habilitar el bloqueo de honeypot"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:541
msgid "Activate Honeypot trap protection."
msgstr "Activar la protección contra trampas Honeypot."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:542
#, php-format
msgid "Manage Honeypot URLs in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocking Rules</a> tab."
msgstr ""
"Administre las URL de Honeypot en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Reglas de "
"bloqueo</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:546
msgid "Honeypot Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración del honeypot (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:546
msgid ""
"Block duration for IPs that fall into a honeypot URL. Set to 0 for a "
"permanent block."
msgstr ""
"Duración del bloqueo para IP con una URL trampa honeypot. Se establece en 0 "
"para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:549
msgid "Enable User-Agent Blocking"
msgstr "Habilitar el bloqueo User-Agent"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:549
msgid "Activate User-Agent based blocking."
msgstr "Bloqueo por User-Agent."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:549
#, php-format
msgid "Manage User-Agent lists in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocking Rules</a> tab."
msgstr ""
"Administre las listas de User-Agent en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Reglas de "
"bloqueo</a>."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:550
msgid "User-Agent Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración User-Agent (min)"

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:550
msgid ""
"Block duration for IPs with a malicious User-Agent. Set to 0 for a permanent "
"block."
msgstr ""
"Duración del bloqueo para IP con un User-Agent. malicioso. Se establece en 0 "
"para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:553
msgid "Verify Known Bots"
msgstr "Verificar bots conocidos"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:559
msgid ""
"Enable reverse DNS verification for known crawlers (e.g., Googlebot, "
"Bingbot)."
msgstr ""
"Habilite la verificación de DNS inversa para rastreadores conocidos (por "
"ejemplo, Googlebot, Bingbot)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:560
msgid ""
"This prevents attackers from bypassing rules by faking their User-Agent. If "
"an IP claims to be Googlebot but fails verification, it will be treated as a "
"threat."
msgstr ""
"Esto evita que los atacantes eludan las reglas falsificando su User-Agent. "
"Si una IP afirma ser Googlebot pero no pasa la verificación, se considerará "
"una amenaza."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:567
msgid "Verify AI Bots (CIDR)"
msgstr "Verificar bots de IA (CIDR)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:573
msgid "Enable IP CIDR verification for AI crawlers (e.g., OpenAI, ChatGPT)."
msgstr ""
"Habilitar la verificación de IP CIDR para rastreadores de IA (por ejemplo, "
"OpenAI, ChatGPT)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:574
msgid ""
"Downloads official JSON IP lists from AI providers to verify their crawlers "
"reliably, bypassing rDNS limitations."
msgstr ""
"Descarga listas oficiales de direcciones IP en formato JSON de proveedores "
"de IA para verificar sus rastreadores de forma fiable, sorteando las "
"limitaciones de rDNS."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:581
msgid "Verify Monitoring Bots (IP List)"
msgstr "Verificar bots de monitoreo (lista de IPs)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:587
msgid ""
"Enable IP verification for Monitoring Bots (e.g., Uptime Robot, Pingdom)."
msgstr ""
"Habilite la verificación de IP para bots de monitoreo (p. ej., Uptime Robot, "
"Pingdom)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:588
msgid ""
"Downloads official IP lists from monitoring services to allow legitimate "
"pings and block impersonators."
msgstr ""
"Descarga listas oficiales de direcciones IP de servicios de monitoreo para "
"permitir pings legítimos y bloquear a los impostores."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:602
msgid "Enable automatic blocking using the Spamhaus ASN DROP list."
msgstr ""
"Habilite el bloqueo automático mediante la lista DROP de ASN de Spamhaus."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:603
msgid ""
"Provides a powerful, auto-updating layer of protection against the worst "
"networks on the internet. The list is refreshed daily."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona una potente capa de protección con actualización automática "
"contra las peores redes de internet. La lista se actualiza a diario."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:607
msgid "Manual ASN Protection"
msgstr "Protección ASN Manual"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:607
msgid "Enable blocking based on your custom Manual ASN Blocklist."
msgstr ""
"Habilite el bloqueo según su lista de bloqueo de ASN manual personalizada."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:607
#, php-format
msgid "Manage your custom list in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocking Rules</a> tab."
msgstr ""
"Administre su lista personalizada en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Reglas de "
"bloqueo</a>."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:608
msgid "ASN Block Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración bloqueo ASN (min)"

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:608
msgid ""
"Duration to block IPs from both manual and automated ASN lists. Set to "
"<strong>0</strong> for a permanent block."
msgstr ""
"Duración del bloqueo de IP de listas ASN manuales y automatizadas. Se "
"establece en <strong>0</strong> para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:611
msgid "Block Ghost IPs"
msgstr "Bloquear direcciones IP fantasma"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:617
msgid ""
"Automatically block IPs without ASN and Reverse DNS (Warning: Could cause "
"false positives if rDNS is misconfigured by ISPs)."
msgstr ""
"Bloquear automáticamente las direcciones IP sin ASN ni DNS inverso "
"(Advertencia: podría generar falsos positivos si los proveedores de "
"servicios de Internet tienen mal configurado el rDNS)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:625
msgid "Under Attack Mode"
msgstr "En modo ataque"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:632
msgid "Off (Normal Operation)"
msgstr "Apagado (Funcionamiento normal)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:633
msgid "Auto (Trigger on attack spikes)"
msgstr "Automático (Se activa ante picos de ataque)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:634
msgid "Manual (Always On / Panic Mode)"
msgstr "Manual (Siempre encendido / Modo pánico)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:637
msgid ""
"Activates a global JS Challenge for all non-whitelisted visitors to protect "
"the server."
msgstr ""
"Activa un desafío JS global para todos los visitantes que no estén en la "
"lista blanca para proteger el servidor."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:641
msgid "Trigger Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de activación"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:641
msgid "Total blocks (from any module) required to auto-trigger the Panic Mode."
msgstr ""
"Bloqueos totales (de cualquier módulo) necesarios para activar "
"automáticamente el Modo Pánico."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:642
msgid "Detection Window (sec)"
msgstr "Ventana de detección (segundos)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:642
msgid ""
"The time window in seconds in which the block threshold must be reached."
msgstr ""
"El intervalo de tiempo en segundos en el que se debe alcanzar el umbral de "
"bloqueos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:643
msgid "Panic Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración del pánico (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:643
msgid ""
"How long the Global Challenge will stay active after being auto-triggered."
msgstr ""
"Cuánto tiempo permanecerá activo el Desafío Global después de haberse "
"activado automáticamente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:644
msgid "Choose the type of JS challenge to serve during the Panic Mode."
msgstr "Elige el tipo de desafío JS que se mostrará durante el Modo Pánico."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:645
msgid "Emergency Email"
msgstr "Correo electrónico de emergencia"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:645
msgid "Leave empty to use the standard admin email."
msgstr ""
"Déjelo en blanco para usar el correo electrónico de administrador estándar."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:648
msgid "Panic Alerts"
msgstr "Panic Alerts"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:655
msgid "Send Always (Email & Push)"
msgstr "Enviar siempre (Email & Push)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:656
msgid "Send Push Only (No Email)"
msgstr "Solo envío de notificaciones push (sin email)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:657
msgid "Disabled (Silent Mode)"
msgstr "Desactivado (modo silencioso)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:660
msgid "Choose how you want to be notified when Auto-Panic triggers."
msgstr ""
"Elige cómo quieres recibir notificaciones cuando se active la función de "
"pánico automático."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:663
msgid "Panic Mode Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones del modo pánico"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:663
msgid ""
"Add one URI path or fragment per line (e.g., /wp-json/wc/v3/*). These URLs "
"will NEVER be challenged during Panic Mode. Global Exclusions and WAF "
"Exclusions are also automatically respected."
msgstr ""
"Agregue una ruta o fragmento URI por línea (p. ej., /wp-json/wc/v3/*). Estas "
"URL NUNCA serán cuestionadas durante el Modo Pánico. Las exclusiones "
"globales y las exclusiones del WAF también se respetan automáticamente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:668
msgid "Enable WAF"
msgstr "Habilitar WAF"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:674
