msgstr "Intelligent Zero-Day Sync"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:679
msgid ""
"Automatically download and apply critical WAF zero-day signatures from the "
"AIB Central Server (Daily)."
msgstr ""
"Descargar y aplicar automáticamente firmas críticas zero-day para WAF desde "
"el servidor central de AIB (diariamente)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:680
