msgstr ""
"Descargue y aplique automáticamente las reglas JSON avanzadas desde el "
"servidor central de AIB."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:681
msgid "WAF Block Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración bloqueo WAF (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:681
msgid ""
"Duration to block IPs that trigger a WAF rule. Set to 0 for a permanent "
"block."
msgstr ""
"Duración para bloquear IP que activan una regla WAF. Se establece en 0 para "
"un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:682
msgid "Excluded URLs for WAF"
msgstr "URL excluidas para WAF"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:682
msgid ""
"Add one URL fragment per line. Requests to URLs containing these strings "
"will not be scanned by the WAF. Use this for payment gateway webhooks or "
"problematic AJAX actions."
msgstr ""
"Agregue un fragmento de URL por línea. El WAF no analizará las solicitudes a "
"URL que contengan estas cadenas. Úselo para webhooks de pasarelas de pago o "
"acciones AJAX problemáticas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:687
msgid "Enable 404 Lockdown Mode"
msgstr "Habilitar modo 404 Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:687
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:703
msgid "Activate Distributed Attack Protection"
msgstr "Activar la protección contra ataques distribuidos"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:687
msgid ""
"If enabled, a global \"Lockdown\" will be triggered when too many 404 errors "
"occur from multiple IPs. During lockdown, ALL 404 visitors must solve a JS "
"Challenge."
msgstr ""
"Si está habilitado, se activará un bloqueo global cuando se produzcan "
"demasiados errores 404 desde varias IP. Durante el bloqueo, todos los "
"visitantes que reciban errores 404 deberán resolver un desafío de JavaScript."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:689
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:705
msgid "Lockdown Trigger: Max Errors"
msgstr "Desencadenante Lockdown: Errores máximos"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:689
msgid "Total 404 errors allowed across the entire site..."
msgstr "Total de errores 404 permitidos en todo el sitio..."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:690
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:706
msgid "Lockdown Trigger: Min Unique IPs"
msgstr "Umbral de IP único de Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:690
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:706
msgid "...originating from at least this many unique IPs..."
msgstr "...originados desde al menos esta cantidad de IP únicas..."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:691
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:707
msgid "Lockdown Trigger: Time Window"
msgstr "Desencadenante Lockdown: Ventana de tiempo"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:691
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:707
msgid "...within this many minutes."
msgstr "...en estos minutos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:692
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:708
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:800
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:872
msgid "Lockdown Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración del Lockdown (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:692
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:708
msgid "How long the Lockdown Mode stays active."
msgstr "Cuánto tiempo permanecerá activo el modo  lockdown (en minutos)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:693
msgid "Choose the type of JS challenge to serve during a 404 Lockdown."
msgstr ""
"Elige el tipo de desafío JS que se implementará durante un bloqueo por error "
"404."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:697
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:713
msgid "Single IP: Block Threshold"
msgstr "IP única: Umbral de bloqueo"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:697
msgid "Block a specific IP if it generates this many 404 errors."
msgstr "Bloquear una IP específica si genera esta cantidad de errores 404."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:698
msgid "404 Time Window (min)"
msgstr "404 Ventana de tiempo (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:698
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:714
msgid "Time period in which the error count must be reached."
msgstr "Periodo de tiempo en el que se debe alcanzar el recuento de errores."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:699
msgid "404 Duration (min)"
msgstr "404 Duración (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:699
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:715
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:727
msgid "How long the IP will be blocked."
msgstr "Por cuánto tiempo estará bloqueada la IP."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:703
msgid "Enable 403 Lockdown Mode"
msgstr "Habilitar modo 403 Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:703
msgid ""
"If enabled, a global \"Lockdown\" will be triggered when too many 403 errors "
"occur. During lockdown, ALL 403 visitors must solve a JS Challenge."
msgstr ""
"Si se habilita esta opción, se activará un bloqueo global cuando se "
"produzcan demasiados errores 403. Durante el bloqueo, todos los visitantes "
"que reciban errores 403 deberán resolver un desafío de JavaScript."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:705
msgid "Total 403 errors allowed across the entire site..."
msgstr "Total de errores 403 permitidos en todo el sitio..."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:709
msgid "Choose the type of JS challenge to serve during a 403 Lockdown."
msgstr ""
"Elige el tipo de desafío JS que se implementará durante un bloqueo por error "
"403."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:713
msgid "Block a specific IP if it generates this many 403 errors."
msgstr "Bloquear una IP específica si genera esta cantidad de errores 403."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:714
msgid "403 Time Window (min)"
msgstr "403 Ventana de tiempo (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:715
msgid "403 Duration (min)"
msgstr "403 Duración (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:718
msgid "Enable Rate Limiting"
msgstr "Habilitar limitación Rate"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:718
msgid "Temporarily block IPs that make too many requests."
msgstr "Bloquear temporalmente las IP que realizan demasiadas solicitudes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:719
msgid "Request Limit"
msgstr "Límite de solicitudes"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:719
msgid "Number of requests to allow within the time window."
msgstr "Número de solicitudes a permitir dentro de la ventana de tiempo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:720
msgid "Time Window (seconds)"
msgstr "Ventana de tiempo (segundos)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:720
msgid "The time period in which the request count is measured."
msgstr "El período de tiempo en el que se mide el recuento de solicitudes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:721
msgid "How long the IP will be blocked after reaching the limit."
msgstr ""
"Cuánto tiempo permanecerá bloqueada la IP después de alcanzar el límite."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:722
msgid "Define specific limits for different endpoints."
msgstr "Defina límites específicos para diferentes  endpoints."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:725
msgid "Login Failure Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de fallo de inicio de sesión"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:725
msgid "Number of failed logins to trigger a block."
msgstr "Número de inicios de sesión fallidos para activar un bloqueo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:726
msgid "Login Time Window (min)"
msgstr "Ventana de tiempo de inicio de sesión (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:726
msgid "Time period in which the failure count must be reached."
msgstr "Periodo de tiempo en el cual se debe alcanzar el conteo de fallas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:727
msgid "Login Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración del inicio de sesión"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:730
msgid "Auto-Whitelist Admins"
msgstr "Auto-Whitelist Admins"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:730
msgid ""
"Automatically add administrator IPs to the whitelist on successful login."
msgstr ""
"Agregar automáticamente las IP de administrador a la lista blanca luego de "
"iniciar sesión exitosamente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:730
msgid "Ideal for admins who travel or have dynamic IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"Ideal para administradores que viajan o tienen direcciones IP dinámicas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:731
msgid "REST API User Protection"
msgstr "Protección del usuario de la API REST"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:731
msgid "Disable User Enumeration via REST API"
msgstr "Deshabilitar la enumeración de usuarios a través de la API REST"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:732
msgid "Prevent user enumeration via author scans"
msgstr "Prevenir la enumeración de usuarios mediante escaneos de autor"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:733
msgid "Strict Author Scan Block"
msgstr "Bloqueo estricto de escaneo de autores"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:735
msgid "Block author scans with 403 Error"
msgstr "Bloquear los escaneos de autores con un error 403"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:736
msgid ""
"Instead of a 301 redirect, return a 403 Access Denied error. This will log "
"the event and sum Threat Score points (as a 403 Error)."
msgstr ""
"En lugar de una redirección 301, devuelva un error 403 de acceso denegado. "
"Esto registrará el evento y sumará puntos a la puntuación de amenaza (como "
"un error 403)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:746
msgid ""
"Prevent WordPress from revealing whether a username or email exists on login "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"Evita que WordPress revele si existe un nombre de usuario o un correo "
"electrónico en caso de error de inicio de sesión."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:747
msgid ""
"Shows a generic error message for all login and \"lost password\" failures "
"to prevent user enumeration."
msgstr ""
"Muestra un mensaje de error genérico para todos los fallos de inicio de "
"sesión y de \"contraseña perdida\" para evitar la enumeración de usuarios."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:752
msgid "Whitelist Login Countries"
msgstr "Países de inicio de sesión en la lista blanca"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:754
msgid ""
"Select one or more countries that are allowed to access wp-login.php. If "
"empty, all countries are allowed."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione uno o más países con permiso para acceder a wp-login.php. Si deja "
"el campo vacío, se permite el acceso a todos los países."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:759
msgid "XML-RPC Block Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración Bloqueo XML-RPC (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:759
msgid ""
"How long to block IPs that make suspicious XML-RPC requests. Set to 0 for a "
"permanent block."
msgstr ""
"Durante cuánto tiempo se deben bloquear las IP que realizan solicitudes XML-"
"RPC sospechosas. Se establece en 0 para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:770
msgid "Enable automated protection against distributed XML-RPC attacks."
msgstr ""
"Habilite la protección automatizada contra ataques XML-RPC distribuidos."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:771
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When a sustained attack is detected, this mode will temporarily challenge "
"all non-whitelisted traffic to <code>xmlrpc.php</code> with a JavaScript "
"verifier, stopping the attack without flooding your block list. Manage "
"endpoints that are currently in \"Lockdown Mode\" in the <a "
"href=\"%s\">Blocked Endpoints</a> tab."
msgstr ""
"Al detectar un ataque continuo, este modo verificará temporalmente todo el "
"tráfico no incluido en la lista blanca de <code>xmlrpc.php</code> con un "
"verificador de JavaScript, deteniendo el ataque sin saturar la lista de "
"bloqueos. Gestione los endpoints que se encuentran actualmente en \"Modo de "
"bloqueo\" en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Endpoints bloqueados</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:776
msgid "Lockdown Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:783
msgid ""
"Number of unique IP blocks on <code>xmlrpc.php</code> needed to trigger the "
"lockdown."
msgstr ""
"Número de bloqueos de IP únicos en <code>xmlrpc.php</code> necesarios para "
"activar lockdown."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:788
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:860
msgid "Lockdown Detection Window (min)"
msgstr "Ventana de detección de Lockdown (mín.)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:795
msgid "The time frame (in minutes) in which the threshold must be reached."
msgstr ""
"El período de tiempo (en minutos) en el que se debe alcanzar el umbral."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:807
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:879
msgid "How long the lockdown mode will remain active (in minutes)."
msgstr "Cuánto tiempo permanecerá activo el modo  lockdown (en minutos)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:818
msgid ""
"Choose the type of JS challenge to serve to non-whitelisted XML-RPC traffic "
"during lockdown."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el tipo de desafío JS que se aplicará al tráfico XML-RPC no "
"incluido en la lista blanca durante el periodo de bloqueo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:830
msgid "Enable automated protection against distributed brute-force attacks."
msgstr ""
"Habilite la protección automatizada contra ataques de fuerza bruta "
"distribuidos."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:831
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When a sustained brute-force attack is detected, this mode will temporarily "
"challenge all non-whitelisted traffic to <code>wp-login.php</code> with a "
"JavaScript verifier.Manage endpoints that are currently in \"Lockdown Mode\" "
"in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocked Endpoints</a> tab."
msgstr ""
"Al detectar un ataque de fuerza bruta, este modo verificará temporalmente "
"todo el tráfico no incluido en la lista blanca de <code>wp-login.php</code> "
"con un verificador de JavaScript, deteniendo el ataque sin saturar la lista "
"de bloqueos. Gestione los endpoints que se encuentran actualmente en \"Modo "
"de bloqueo\" en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Endpoints bloqueados</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:836
msgid "Lockdown Event Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de evento Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:843
msgid "Total number of failed login attempts needed to trigger the lockdown."
msgstr ""
"Número total de intentos fallidos de inicio de sesión necesarios para "
"activar el lockdown."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:848
msgid "Lockdown Unique IP Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de IP único de Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:855
msgid "Minimum number of unique IPs that must contribute to the failed logins."
msgstr ""
"Número mínimo de IP únicas que deben contribuir a los inicios de sesión "
"fallidos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:867
msgid "The time frame (in minutes) in which the thresholds must be reached."
msgstr ""
"El período de tiempo (en minutos) en el que se deben alcanzar los umbrales."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:890
msgid "Choose the type of JS challenge to serve during a Login Page Lockdown."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el tipo de desafío JS que se mostrará durante un bloqueo de la "
"página de inicio de sesión."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:894
msgid "Enable reCAPTCHA"
msgstr "Habilitar reCAPTCHA"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:896
msgid "Site Key"
msgstr "Cave de sitio web"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:897
msgid "Secret Key"
msgstr "Clave secreta"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:898
msgid "v3 Score Threshold"
msgstr "v3 Umbral de puntuación"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:902
msgid "Default Challenge Engine"
msgstr "Default Challenge Engine"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:905
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2775
msgid "JS Challenge (Managed / Checkbox)"
msgstr "Desafío JS (Gestionado / Casilla de verificación)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:906
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2776
msgid "JS Challenge (Automatic / Transparent)"
msgstr "Desafío JS (automático / transparente)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:910
msgid ""
"Select the default engine used when serving challenges (e.g. Rate Limiting, "
"Under Attack Mode, Lockdowns). Note: Geo Challenge remains separate."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el motor predeterminado que se utilizará al gestionar los "
"desafíos (p. ej., limitación de tasa, modo «bajo ataque» o bloqueos). Tenga "
"en cuenta que el desafío geográfico (Geo Challenge) permanece separado."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:914
msgid "Turnstile Site Key"
msgstr "Turnstile Site Key"

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:919
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You can get your Turnstile keys from the <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cloudflare Dashboard</a>."
msgstr ""
"Puedes obtener tus claves de Turnstile en el <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">panel de control de "
"Cloudflare</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:924
msgid "Turnstile Secret Key"
msgstr "Turnstile Secret Key"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:930
msgid "hCaptcha Site Key"
msgstr "hCaptcha Site Key"

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:935
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You can get your hCaptcha keys from the <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hCaptcha Dashboard</a>."
msgstr ""
"Puedes obtener tus claves de hCaptcha en el <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">panel de control de hCaptcha</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:939
msgid "hCaptcha Secret Key"
msgstr "hCaptcha Secret Key"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:954
msgid "Enable Two-Factor Authentication"
msgstr "Habilitar la autenticación de dos factores"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:960
msgid "Enable the 2FA feature for all users on this site."
msgstr "Habilite la función 2FA para todos los usuarios de este sitio."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:961
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When enabled, users will see the 2FA setup section in their  <a "
"href=\"%s\">Profile</a>."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esté habilitado, los usuarios verán la sección de configuración 2FA "
"en su <a href=\"%s\">Perfil</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:977
msgid "Enable Htaccess Writer"
msgstr "Habilitar Htaccess Writer"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:983
msgid "Allow the plugin to modify the .htaccess file."
msgstr "Permitir que el plugin modifique el archivo .htaccess."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:984
msgid ""
"This is required for all server-level blocking features. The plugin creates "
"a backup before every write operation."
msgstr ""
"Esto es necesario para todas las funciones de bloqueo a nivel de servidor. "
"El plugin crea una copia de seguridad antes de cada operación de escritura."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:991
msgid "Sync Blocked IPs"
msgstr "Sincronización de IPs bloqueadas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:997
msgid ""
"Automatically write \"Manually Blocked\" and \"Permanent\" IPs to "
"the .htaccess file."
msgstr ""
"Escribir automáticamente las direcciones IP \"Bloqueadas manualmente\" y "
"\"Permanentemente\" en el archivo .htaccess."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1003
msgid "Include Temporary Blocks"
msgstr "Incluir bloqueos temporales"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1009
msgid ""
"Write ALL blocked IPs (including temporary ones like 404/Login) to .htaccess."
msgstr ""
"Escriba TODAS las IP bloqueadas (incluidas las temporales como 404/Login) "
"en .htaccess."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1010
msgid ""
"<strong>Advanced Performance:</strong> Offloads temporary blocks to the "
"server. The file updates automatically when IPs expire. Requires \"Sync "
"Blocked IPs\" to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Rendimiento avanzado:</strong> Descarga los bloqueos temporales al "
"servidor. El archivo se actualiza automáticamente cuando caducan las "
"direcciones IP. Requiere que esté habilitada la opción «Sincronizar "
"direcciones IP bloqueadas»."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1016
msgid "Block System Files"
msgstr "Bloquear archivos del sistema"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1022
msgid "Block access to sensitive files (.git, .svn, .log, .sql, backups, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Bloquear el acceso a archivos confidenciales (.git, .svn, .log, .sql, copias "
"de seguridad, etc.)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1028
msgid "Block wp-config.php"
msgstr "Bloquea wp-config.php"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1034
msgid "Block direct access to wp-config.php and wp-config-sample.php"
msgstr "Bloquear el acceso directo a wp-config.php y wp-config-sample.php"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1040
msgid "Block Readme Files"
msgstr "Bloquear Archivos Readme"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1046
msgid ""
"Block access to readme.html and license.txt (prevents version enumeration)"
msgstr ""
"Bloquear el acceso a readme.html y license.txt (impide la enumeración de "
"versiones)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1054
msgid "Enable Cloudflare Integration"
msgstr "Habilitar la integración de Cloudflare"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1060
msgid "Activate synchronization with Cloudflare Firewall."
msgstr "Activar la sincronización con Cloudflare Firewall."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1067
msgid "Cloudflare Safe-Guard"
msgstr "Cloudflare Safe-Guard"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1073
msgid ""
"Protect official Cloudflare infrastructure, CDN perimeter nodes, and "
"internal scanners (e.g., CloudflareWebScanner) from being blacklisted by "
"local WAF rules, User-Agent pattern matching, or Threat Scoring."
msgstr ""
"Proteja la infraestructura oficial de Cloudflare, los nodos perimetrales de "
"la CDN y los escáneres internos (p. ej., CloudflareWebScanner) para evitar "
"que sean incluidos en listas negras por reglas locales de WAF, coincidencias "
"de patrones de User-Agent o sistemas de puntuación de amenazas (Threat "
"Scoring)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1079
msgid "Cloudflare API Token"
msgstr "Token de API de Cloudflare"

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1088
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Create a token with <strong>Zone > Firewall > Edit</strong> permissions. <a "
"href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Get Token</a>"
msgstr ""
"Crea un token con permisos de <strong>Zone > Firewall > Edit</strong>. <a "
"href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Obtener token</a>"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1096
msgid "Zone ID"
msgstr "Zone ID"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1103
msgid ""
"Found on the \"Overview\" page of your domain in Cloudflare (bottom right)."
msgstr ""
"Se encuentra en la página \"Descripción general\" de su dominio en "
"Cloudflare (abajo a la derecha)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1109
msgid "Sync Manual Blocks"
msgstr "Sincronizar bloqueos manuales"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1115
msgid "Push \"Manually Blocked\" IPs to Cloudflare."
msgstr "Envía direcciones IP \"bloqueadas manualmente\" a Cloudflare."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1121
msgid "Sync Temporary Blocks"
msgstr "Sincronizar bloqueos temporales"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1127
msgid "Push temporary blocks (WAF, Login attempts, etc.) to Cloudflare."
msgstr ""
"Envía bloqueos temporales (WAF, intentos de inicio de sesión, etc.) a "
"Cloudflare."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1128
msgid ""
"<strong>Recommended for High Security.</strong> Offload all bad traffic to "
"the cloud."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Recomendado para alta seguridad.</strong> Descargue todo el tráfico "
"malo a la nube."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1133
msgid "Check to delete all data from this plugin when it is deleted."
msgstr ""
"Marcar para borrar todos los datos de este plugin cuando sea desinstalado ."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1138
msgid "Enable Threat Scoring System"
msgstr "Habilitar el sistema de puntuación de amenazas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1144
msgid "Activate the dynamic IP threat scoring system."
msgstr "Activar el sistema dinámico de puntuación de amenazas de IP."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1145
msgid ""
"When enabled, the plugin will assign threat points to IPs for malicious "
"actions instead of using simple thresholds. An IP will be blocked only when "
"its total score reaches the configured threshold."
msgstr ""
"Al habilitarse, el plugin asignará puntos de amenaza a las IP por acciones "
"maliciosas en lugar de usar umbrales simples. Una IP se bloqueará solo "
"cuando su puntuación total alcance el umbral configurado."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1150
msgid "Blocking Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de bloqueo"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1153
msgid ""
"An IP will be blocked when its threat score reaches or exceeds this value."
msgstr ""
"Una IP se bloqueará cuando su puntuación de amenaza alcance o supere este "
"valor."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1159
msgid ""
"How long an IP will be blocked after reaching the threshold. Set to 0 for a "
"permanent block."
msgstr ""
"Cuánto tiempo se bloqueará una IP tras alcanzar el límite. Se establece en 0 "
"para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1162
msgid "Threat Event Points"
msgstr "Puntos de eventos de amenaza"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1164
msgid "Score Decay Rate"
msgstr "Tasa de caída de puntuación"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1167
msgid ""
"Number of points to subtract from an inactive IP's score during each decay "
"cycle."
msgstr ""
"Número de puntos a restar de la puntuación de una IP inactiva durante cada "
"ciclo de decadencia."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1170
msgid "Score Decay Frequency (Hours)"
msgstr "Frecuencia de caída de la puntuación (horas)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1173
msgid ""
"How often (in hours) to run the decay process. The score of an IP will only "
"decay if it has been inactive for at least this period."
msgstr ""
"Frecuencia (en horas) con la que se ejecuta el proceso de decaimiento. La "
"puntuación de una IP solo decaerá si ha estado inactiva durante al menos "
"este periodo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1180
msgid "Enable Signature Logging"
msgstr "Habilitar el registro de firmas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1186
msgid "Activate the experimental request fingerprinting engine."
msgstr "Activa el motor experimental de huella digital de solicitudes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1187
msgid ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> This is an advanced feature for data collection. "
"Activating it will log details of incoming requests to a new database table. "
"Use only if you are aware of the potential performance impact on high-"
"traffic sites."
msgstr ""
"Advertencia: Esta es una función avanzada para la recopilación de datos. Al "
"activarla, se registrarán los detalles de las solicitudes entrantes en una "
"nueva tabla de la base de datos. Úsela solo si conoce el posible impacto en "
"el rendimiento en sitios con mucho tráfico."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1192
msgid "Enable Signature Analysis"
msgstr "Habilitar análisis de firma"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1194
msgid "Activate automatic analysis of request signatures."
msgstr "Activar el análisis automático de las firmas de solicitud."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1195
msgid ""
"When enabled, a background process will analyze the collected logs to find "
"patterns of a distributed attack."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, un proceso en segundo plano analizará los registros "
"recopilados para encontrar patrones de un ataque distribuido."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1198
msgid "Enable Signature Blocking"
msgstr "Habilitar bloqueo de firmas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1200
msgid "Activate blocking based on malicious signatures."
msgstr "Activar el bloqueo basado en firmas maliciosas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1201
msgid ""
"<strong>Enable this to activate protection.</strong> When a request matches "
"a known malicious signature, the plugin will present a JavaScript challenge "
"to filter out bots."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Habilite esto para activar la protección.</strong> Cuando una "
"solicitud coincide con una firma maliciosa conocida, el complemento "
"presentará un desafío de JavaScript para filtrar los bots."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1206
msgid ""
"Choose the type of JS challenge to serve when defending against distributed "
"attacks."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el tipo de desafío JS que se utilizará para defenderse de ataques "
"distribuidos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1209
msgid "Signature IP Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de IP de firma"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1212
msgid ""
"The minimum number of different IPs that must use the same attack signature "
"to be flagged as malicious."
msgstr ""
"La cantidad mínima de IP diferentes que deben usar la misma firma de ataque "
"para ser marcadas como maliciosas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1215
msgid "Analysis Window (Hours)"
msgstr "Ventana de análisis (horas)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1218
msgid "How far back (in hours) the analysis process should look for patterns."
msgstr ""
"Hasta dónde (en horas) debe llegar el proceso de análisis para buscar "
"patrones."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1221
msgid "Signature Rule Lifetime (Hours)"
msgstr "Duración de la regla de firma (horas)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1224
msgid "How long a malicious signature will remain active before it expires."
msgstr "Cuánto tiempo permanecerá activa una firma maliciosa antes de caducar."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1229
msgid "How often to send alerts for detected signatures."
msgstr "Con qué frecuencia enviar alertas para firmas detectadas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1232
msgid "Notification Recipient"
msgstr "Destinatario de la notificación"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1234
msgid "Who should receive these specific alerts."
msgstr "Quién debe recibir estas alertas específicas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1237
msgid "Custom Recipient Email"
msgstr "Correo electrónico del destinatario personalizado"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1240
msgid "Required if \"Custom Email\" is selected above."
msgstr ""
"Obligatorio si se selecciona \"Correo electrónico personalizado\" arriba."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1244
msgid "Trusted Signature Hashes"
msgstr "Hashes de firma confiables"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1246
msgid ""
"Add known legitimate signature hashes here (one per line). Requests matching "
"these exact fingerprints will always be allowed and never logged by the "
"Signature Engine. Use this for services like Googlebot, Facebook Crawler, "
"etc., to prevent false positives. Find hashes in the \"Blocked Signatures\" "
"page by clicking \"View Details\"."
msgstr ""
"Agregue aquí hashes de firma legítimos conocidos (uno por línea). Las "
"solicitudes que coincidan con estas huellas digitales exactas siempre se "
"permitirán y el motor de firmas nunca las registrará. Úselo para servicios "
"como Googlebot, Facebook Crawler, etc., para evitar falsos positivos. "
"Encuentre los hashes en la página \"Firmas bloqueadas\" haciendo clic en "
"\"Ver detalles\"."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1254
msgid "Enable Activity Audit Log"
msgstr "Habilitar el registro de auditoría de actividad"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1260
msgid "Record critical administrative actions."
msgstr "Registrar acciones administrativas críticas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1261
msgid ""
"Logs plugin rule changes, setting updates, and other critical admin events "
"to a separate audit table."
msgstr ""
"Registra los cambios de reglas del plugin, las actualizaciones de "
"configuración y otros eventos administrativos críticos en una tabla de "
"auditoría separada."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1267
msgid "Enable File Integrity Monitor"
msgstr "Habilitar el Monitor de Integridad de Archivos"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1273
msgid "Monitor critical WordPress files for unauthorized changes."
msgstr ""
"Supervise los archivos críticos de WordPress para detectar cambios no "
"autorizados."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1274
msgid ""
"Automatically scans core files (wp-config.php, .htaccess, index.php) daily "
"for modifications."
msgstr ""
"Escanea automáticamente los archivos principales (wp-config.php, .htaccess, "
"index.php) diariamente para detectar modificaciones."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1280
msgid "Scan Uploads Directory"
msgstr "Escanear directorio de subidas"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1286
msgid ""
"Scan the wp-content/uploads directory for suspicious executable files "
"(.php). Legitimate index.php files are safely ignored."
msgstr ""
"Analice el directorio wp-content/uploads en busca de archivos ejecutables "
"sospechosos (.php). Los archivos index.php legítimos se omiten de forma "
"segura."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1292
msgid "Enable Raw String Signatures"
msgstr "Habilitar firmas de cadenas Raw"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1298
msgid "Detect malware using ultra-fast exact string matching."
msgstr ""
"Detecte malware mediante la coincidencia exacta de cadenas ultrarrápida."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1299
msgid ""
"Recommended. This is the fastest and most common method for detecting known "
"malware strings."
msgstr ""
"Recomendado. Este es el método más rápido y común para detectar cadenas de "
"malware conocidas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1305
msgid "Enable RegEx Signatures"
msgstr "Habilitar firmas RegEx"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1311
msgid "Detect highly obfuscated malware using Regular Expressions."
msgstr "Detecta malware altamente ofuscado mediante expresiones regulares."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1312
msgid "Advanced. Uses more CPU but detects polymorphic backdoors."
msgstr "Avanzado. Consume más CPU, pero detecta puertas traseras polimórficas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1318
msgid "Enable Domain Signatures"
msgstr "Habilitar firmas de dominio"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1324
msgid "Detect malicious domains, APIs, and C2 servers inside files."
msgstr ""
"Detecta dominios, API y servidores de comando y control (C2) maliciosos "
"dentro de archivos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1325
msgid "Recommended. Very fast check for external malicious requests."
msgstr ""
"Recomendado. Verificación muy rápida de solicitudes externas maliciosas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1331
msgid "Enable MD5 Hash Signatures"
msgstr "Habilitar firmas hash MD5"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1337
msgid "Identify known malware files instantly using MD5 hashes."
msgstr ""
"Identifique archivos de malware conocidos al instante mediante hashes MD5."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1338
msgid ""
"Recommended. Skips reading file contents if the hash matches known malware."
msgstr ""
"Recomendado. Omite la lectura del contenido del archivo si el hash coincide "
"con malware conocido."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1344
msgid "Enable SHA256 Hash Signatures"
msgstr "Habilitar firmas hash SHA256"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1350
msgid "Identify known malware files using SHA256 hashes."
msgstr "Identifique archivos de malware conocidos mediante hashes SHA256."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1351
msgid "Slower than MD5 but highly accurate."
msgstr "Más lento que MD5 pero altamente preciso."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1357
msgid "Excluded Paths for FIM"
msgstr "Rutas excluidas para FIM"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1363
msgid ""
"Add one path fragment per line. If a scanned file's path contains any of "
"these strings, it will be ignored by the FIM. Example: <code>wp-content/"
"uploads/cache/</code>"
msgstr ""
"Añada un fragmento de ruta por línea. Si la ruta de un archivo escaneado "
"contiene alguna de estas cadenas, el FIM la ignorará. Ejemplo: <code>wp-"
"content/uploads/cache/</code>"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1369
msgid "FIM Alert Email"
msgstr "Correo electrónico de alerta FIM"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1375
msgid ""
"Where to send critical file change alerts (leave blank for admin email)."
msgstr ""
"Dónde enviar alertas de cambios críticos de archivos (déjelo en blanco para "
"el correo electrónico del administrador)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1388
msgid "Daily (Recommended)"
msgstr "Diariamente (recomendado)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1389
msgid "Twice a day (Every 12 hours)"
msgstr "Dos veces al día (cada 12 horas)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1390
msgid "High Security (Every 6 hours - Warning: Consumes more resources)"
msgstr "Alta seguridad (Cada 6 horas - Advertencia: consume más recursos)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1397
msgid "Manual Scan"
msgstr "Escaneo manual"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:1541
