msgstr "ASN bloqueado (Spamhaus)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2170
msgid ""
"Assign the number of threat points for each event. An event with 100 or more "
"points will trigger an instant block, regardless of the threshold."
msgstr ""
"Asigna la cantidad de puntos de amenaza para cada evento. Un evento con 100 "
"o más puntos activará un bloqueo instantáneo, independientemente del umbral."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2178
